@startuml
title Open Art Register — Public Demo & Evidence

rectangle "Public Git Repository" {
  component "README" as README
  component "Static Homepage Demo" as HOME
  component "Static Example Statistics" as STATS
  component "DE / EN only" as I18N
  component "Boundary Tests" as TESTS
  component "Public Health Workflow" as GH
}

cloud "openartregister.art" as OAR
database "Productive Database" as DB

I18N --> HOME
I18N --> STATS
TESTS --> HOME : static validation
TESTS --> STATS : synthetic-data boundary
TESTS --> README : allowlist / hashes
GH -> OAR : GET /api/health
OAR -> DB : existing read-only health check
OAR --> GH : sanitized {"ok":true} / fail

note bottom of HOME
Only DE/EN controls are interactive.
Yellow viewport-fixed demo tape.
All productive UI actions are disabled.
No production application code.
end note

note bottom of STATS
Synthetic example data only.
Same yellow viewport-fixed tape.
BEISPIEL / EXAMPLE additionally marked.
end note

note right of TESTS
Fail closed:
Unexpected files = FAIL
All 6 production roots = FAIL
Secrets / SQL / archives = FAIL
end note
@enduml
